{"id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#ex:fourier-transform-heat-fundamental-solution","title":"ex:fourier-transform-heat-fundamental-solution","path":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4.md","line":244,"body":"","kind":"other","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4.tex#ex:fourier-transform-heat-fundamental-solution","uses":["[[references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#thm:fourier-transform-properties]]","[[references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#ex:bessel-potentials]]","[[references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:heat-equation-initial-value-solution]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4.tex","label":"ex:fourier-transform-heat-fundamental-solution","line":355,"source":"\\begin{example}[Fundamental solution of the heat equation, via Fourier transform]\n\\label{ex:fourier-transform-heat-fundamental-solution}\n\\uses{thm:fourier-transform-properties, ex:bessel-potentials, thm:heat-equation-initial-value-solution}\n\\dcref{ch4:4.3.1-ex-2}\n\\group{Fourier Transform}\n\nFourier transformation in $x$ reduces the heat initial-value problem to\n$\\hat u_t+|y|^2\\hat u=0$, so\n\\[\nu(x,t)=\\frac1{(4\\pi t)^{n/2}}\\int_{\\R^n}e^{-|x-y|^2/(4t)}g(y)\\,dy.\n\\]\n\\end{example}","html":" <p></p>\\begin{example} \\end{example}[Fundamental solution of the heat equation, via Fourier transform] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-65783a666f75726965722d7472616e73666f726d2d686561742d66756e64616d656e74616c2d736f6c7574696f6e\"></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FEvans%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter4%23thm%3Afourier-transform-properties\">↗ thm:fourier-transform-properties</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FEvans%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter4%23ex%3Abessel-potentials\">↗ ex:bessel-potentials</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FEvans%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23thm%3Aheat-equation-initial-value-solution\">↗ thm:heat-equation-initial-value-solution</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch4:4.3.1-ex-2</span></span>\\group Fourier Transform <p></p>Fourier transformation in <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x$\">$x$</span> reduces the heat initial-value problem to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\hat u_t+|y|^2\\hat u=0$\">$\\hat u_t+|y|^2\\hat u=0$</span>, so <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  u(x,t)=\\frac1{(4\\pi t)^{n/2}}\\int _{\\R ^n}e^{-|x-y|^2/(4t)}g(y)\\, dy.  \\]\">\\[  u(x,t)=\\frac1{(4\\pi t)^{n/2}}\\int _{\\R ^n}e^{-|x-y|^2/(4t)}g(y)\\, dy.  \\]</span> \\end{example}","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: example、group"]},"previous":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#ex:bessel-potentials","next":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#ex:schrodinger-fundamental-solution","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#thm:fourier-transform-properties","title":"thm:fourier-transform-properties","label":"thm:fourier-transform-properties"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#ex:bessel-potentials","title":"ex:bessel-potentials","label":"ex:bessel-potentials"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:heat-equation-initial-value-solution","title":"thm:heat-equation-initial-value-solution","label":"thm:heat-equation-initial-value-solution"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#ex:schrodinger-fundamental-solution","title":"ex:schrodinger-fundamental-solution","label":"ex:schrodinger-fundamental-solution"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#ex:ho